        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "5. 以下可以作为C++标识符的是（ ）。A. number_of_Chinese_people_in_millionsB. 360AntiVirusC. Man&WomanD. break"
