    [
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "11. 如果 a 和 b 均为 int 类型的变量，下列表达式能正确判断“a 等于 0 且 b等于0”的是（ ）。A. (a == b == 0)B. !(a || b)C. (a + b == 0)D. (a == 0) + (b == 0)"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                142,
                107,
                850,
                281
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "12. 如果a 和b 为int 类型的变量，且值分别为7 和2，则下列哪个表达式的计算结果不是3.5？（ ）A. 0.0 + a / bB. (a + 0.0) / bC. (0.0 + a) / bD. a / (0.0 + b)"
                    }
